  <string name="ui_activity_server_setup_text_315b29" formatted="false">1. server environment</string>
  <string name="ui_activity_server_setup_text_4460ec" formatted="false">OpenSSH will be installed if not available. The operating sshd will remain running. The auto-start and sshd configuration will be maintained. File folder: Termux / LocalLS.</string>
  <string name="ui_activity_server_setup_text_66834d" formatted="false">3. Entry and preparation of SCH</string>
  <string name="ui_activity_server_setup_text_b06c59" formatted="false">Pass the file to another device and press \"Import Profile.\" Check the SSH key to the server. The password is entered separately and does not fit into the profile.</string>
  <string name="ui_activity_server_setup_text_ca7fb6" formatted="false">4. Connecting another device</string>
  <string name="ui_activity_server_setup_text_cd1cd9" formatted="false">In the system selection of folders, open the Termux section and choose its root folder. The other settings will be maintained.</string>
  <string name="ui_activity_server_setup_text_e25347" formatted="false">On the server device, prepare the SSH, on the other device import the profile.</string>
  <string name="ui_activity_server_setup_text_e39d62" formatted="false">Set up the official Termux and open it once to prepare the Wednesday. Come back here. You don\'t have to print anything in it.</string>
  <string name="ui_activity_server_setup_text_e7ef10" formatted="false">2. Access to the Termux folder</string>
